    "description": "Featured on the 2022 AIA tour! Unique condominium homes that capture the essence of San Francisco living located at Noe Valley and Valencia Streets. This is a 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom urban home featuring an open floor plan that flows graciously to a spacious terrace with city views & features designer finishes handpicked to create a home as unique as you & your life. Bespoke kitchen with generous island, ample cabinetry, premium appliances and stone countertops. Sunny living room with floor to ceiling windows opens to a large private terrace with downtown views. Primary suite with spa-like bath, walk-in closet. Large second bedroom with work from home office space overlooking palm-lined Dolores Street and a luxurious second bath. Multi-zone AC, smart features. Just steps to world class dining, shopping and culture, the best of San Francisco is at your doorstep. a custom home automation system with hard-wired smart doorbell, smart lock with Apple tap-to-unlock, Lutron switches, occupancy sensors, Ecobee thermostat, and a smart towel warmer. Additional features include Honeycomb shades, 3M Night Vision film, upgraded shower controls with thermostatic valve, washlet with auto flush, new washer and dryer, full-unit WiFi access & Sonic fiber internet. Parking is leased."
  },
